<title>USA: Texaco Capital to redeem 8.95 pct notes.</title>
<headline>Texaco Capital to redeem 8.95 pct notes.</headline>
<dateline>WHITE PLAINS, N.Y. 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Texaco Capital Inc said on Tuesday it was calling the balance of its 8.95 percent extendible notes due January 15, 2000.</p>
<p>The remaining balance outstanding ot $21.7 million of the original principal amount of $500 million would be redeemed on January 15, the company said.</p>
<p>The extendible notes would be redeemed at a price of 100 percent of their principal amount plus accrued interest to the redemption date, it said.</p>
<p>((New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
